{
  "acs_year": 2024,
  "cbp_year": 2023,

  "exclude_states": {
    "72": "Puerto Rico (ACS covers it, but this project scopes to the 50 states + DC)"
  },

  "_dashboard_comment": [
    "default_community sets which community the dashboard opens on.",
    "  'most_exposed' derives it from the data at build time — the community",
    "  with the highest population-weighted desert score among those of",
    "  250,000+ people — so no community is privileged by authorial choice.",
    "  Setting any group_key below (e.g. 'south_asian') pins it instead, which",
    "  is useful if you are running this for one specific organisation."
  ],
  "dashboard": {
    "default_community": "most_exposed"
  },

  "_groups_comment": [
    "population_groups defines every community you can filter the dashboard by.",
    "All are pulled in the same API calls, so adding a group here costs nothing",
    "at runtime — it just appears in the dashboard dropdown.",
    "",
    "Ordered alphabetically within each category, deliberately: dropdown order",
    "is presentation, and no community should lead it by default.",
    "",
    "'category' controls grouping in the dashboard dropdown.",
    "'variables' are ACS 2024 5-year variable codes, summed together.",
    "Browse codes at https://api.census.gov/data/2024/acs/acs5/variables.html",
    "",
    "Source tables:",
    "  B02015 - Asian alone by selected groups",
    "  B02024 - White alone or in any combination by selected groups (ACS codes",
    "           Middle Eastern / North African origins within White)",
    "  B03001 - Hispanic or Latino by specific origin",
    "  B02001 - Race alone (broad categories)"
  ],

  "population_groups": [
